{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29425","headline":"赴职梓潼留别畏之员外同年 · 李商隐","name":"赴职梓潼留别畏之员外同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳兆联翩遇凤凰，雕文羽帐紫金牀。\n桂花香处同高第，柿叶翻时独悼亡。\n乌鹊失栖长不定，鸳鸯何事自相将。\n京华庸蜀三千里，送到咸阳见夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}